    "dateLastActivity": "2026-11-22T21:06:02.598Z",
    "desc": "# Lore:\n\n# **A Stand that clings to its host's back and turns attention against them.**\n\n---\n\n![image.webp](https://trello.com/1/cards/6b02f4f746773929d351c88d/attachments/6b035630538c7cc378374558/previews/6b035631538c7cc37837465d/download/image.webp)\n\n## Pose:\n\n![image.webp](https://trello.com/1/cards/6b02f4f746773929d351c88d/attachments/6b03563f2d8dac5582da6401/previews/6b03563f2d8dac5582da642b/download/image.webp)\n\n---\n\n## **Cry For Help**\n\n**Draw nearby opponents' attention toward the host.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 12s**\n\n![heklp.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6b02f4f746773929d351c88d/attachments/6b03590e820a03c121d82e8b/previews/6b035911820a03c121d83317/download/heklp.gif)\n\n## Insult!\n\n**Gain 15% of your EX meter. Provoke nearby enemy NPCs and make enemy players rush the host for one light attack.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 10s**\n\n![taunt.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6b02f4f746773929d351c88d/attachments/6b0358a0fc492b4512f5dd81/previews/6b0358a3fc492b4512f5e3bf/download/taunt.gif)\n\n## Taunt\n\n**Lower the host's damage or resistance by 15% for five seconds.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 12s**\n\n![insult.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6b02f4f746773929d351c88d/attachments/6b03585ebbb7ae4f4ac40c4d/previews/6b035863bbb7ae4f4ac416f4/download/insult.gif)\n\n## SCREAM!\n\n**Stun the current host for the scream animation and deafen them for ten seconds.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 20s**\n\n![screaaam.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6b02f4f746773929d351c88d/attachments/6b0357e8ee2310d37c62927a/previews/6b0357ebee2310d37c629706/download/screaaam.gif)\n\n---\n\n# EX [Awakening Moves]\n\n## Powerful Grip (1 Bar)\n\n**Squeeze the host for damage and stun them for one second.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 14s**\n\n![grip.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6b02f4f746773929d351c88d/attachments/6b0357cedbd58727a356d003/previews/6b0357d0dbd58727a356d5ba/download/grip.gif)",
